  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1308.15 Ignition Lock",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1308.15 Ignition Lock. Each school bus shall be equipped with an ignition lock that requires the use of a key or other device to permit activation of the vehicle starter system.\n\nSource. #8248, eff 1-4-05 (from Saf-C 1307.15); ss by #10439, eff 10-11-13 (see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300); ss by #14005, eff 6-22-24, EXPIRES: 6-22-34 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Saf-C 1300)",
